{"type":"message","id":"4051abd5","parentId":"a0b0592c","timestamp":"2026-04-01T00:50:52.177Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2aupogyrm3cs_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 待办事项\n\n## 频哥交代的待办\n- [x] 频哥问女儿\"喜欢周深哪些歌/故事/歌词\"，问完告诉我 → ✅ 已确认\n\n## 日常提醒\n- [x] 每日日终自动复盘（已设置在 HEARTBEAT.md）\n- [ ] git push 如果失败需要手动处理\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775004652174}}
