{"type":"message","id":"05a23699","parentId":"70339bd4","timestamp":"2026-04-01T00:51:03.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me think about what needs attention:\n\n1. Today is April 1st, 2026 - it's within the phase1 reminder period (April 1-16, Mon/Wed/Fri)\n2. Today is Wednesday - which is in the days list [\"monday\", \"wednesday\", \"friday\"]\n3. So I should send a reminder about the bio exam!\n\nThe reminder says:\n\"📅 兮兮生物实验操作考试倒计时！今天是提醒督促日，别忘了看看兮兮的复习进度～\"\n\nThe exam is on 2026-04-24, and today is April 1. I should mention this to 频哥.\n\n\nI need to reach out proactively about this reminder, but I should avoid the email and calendar channels for now and keep my focus on this specific task.","thinkingSignature":"094ff505e34aa96d61be779829477315e8a1e7c547d6ef393938a4b71eaf269d"},{"type":"text","text":"📅 **兮兮生物实验操作考试提醒**（April 1st, 2026）\n\n今天是**提醒督促日**～ 📅\n距离生物实验操作考试还有 **23天**（4月24日），兮兮复习得怎么样了？需要我帮忙抽查什么知识点吗？🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1253,"output":231,"cacheRead":36771,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38255,"cost":{"input":0.0003759,"output":0.00027719999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00220626,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00285936}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775004655923,"responseId":"061b9ef0edf9ed2ba7055238f157d380"}}
