{"type":"message","id":"4f6fa1ba","parentId":"300b5ae4","timestamp":"2026-04-01T10:51:50.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only HEARTBEAT.md is modified, which was just touched but no real content changes needed. The memory files already exist. Let me update MEMORY.md with the important new findings from today's work - the 成都中考生物十年完整分析.\n\nActually, looking at MEMORY.md, it doesn't yet have the complete 成都中考生物十年分析 findings. I should add a note about the key findings. Let me add it to MEMORY.md under a new section.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at MEMORY.md, it has \"女儿各科薄弱点\" but doesn't specifically have the biology exam analysis. Since频哥 and I worked extensively on biology exam questions today, I should add a note about this.\n\nLet me add a section about the biology exam analysis to MEMORY.md. But actually, the analysis is already in memory files. Maybe I should just add a brief summary to MEMORY.md indicating that the十年真题分析 is complete and what the key findings are.\n\nLet me update MEMORY.md with the biology exam key findings.","thinkingSignature":"8c1f611e6f53c0b10290dc908d837f6a24079a85af2e0e1119db3b4714b4e8c1"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qa153rashtbd_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace && git log --oneline -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5013,"output":253,"cacheRead":36771,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42037,"cost":{"input":0.0015038999999999999,"output":0.0003036,"cacheRead":0.00220626,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00401376}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775040701769,"responseId":"061c2bbd5fbdd909054c17bfb8bfeea1"}}
